<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rentsure half yr shr, div rise.</title>
<headline>Rentsure half yr shr, div rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     136.5	 vs   96.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  20.0	 vs   15.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     5.46	vs    3.49</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     8.92	vs    5.26</p>
<p>    Tax			   0.94	vs    0.14</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     1.41	vs    0.84</p>
<p>    Turnover		  108.17	vs   88.66</p>
<p>Div payable: May 15</p>
<p>On register: April 11</p>
<p>Full name: Rentsure Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it expected to perform satisfactorily for the year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
